@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

title AttendanceCommand: build a report
participant "command:AttendanceCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "model:ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant "<<class>>\nAttendanceReport" as Report MODEL_COLOR
[-> Command : execute(model)
activate Command
Command -> Model : getAddressBook().getPersonList()
Model --> Command : all students
Command -> Report : of(students, date, group)
activate Report
note over Report
Include current group members.
Keep their record order.
Present = matching entry.
end note
Report --> Command : report
deactivate Report
[<-- Command : result
deactivate Command
@enduml
